  <p id="c-jinshu-004-jin044-shijian:appointment" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">冬十月辛酉，以司空<persName id="c-jinshu-004-jin044-shijian:appointment:m0009" ref="77n_qzq_xi3">石鑒</persName>爲太尉</p>
  <p id="c-jinshu-004-jin044-shijian:death" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">四年春正月丁酉朔，侍中、太尉、安昌公<persName id="c-jinshu-004-jin044-shijian:death:m0018" ref="77n_qzq_xi3">石鑒</persName>薨。</p>
